From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Schultz <alexschultz002@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 01:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(uc.c): doxygen comments

Hand port of 68249afd onto the patched tree, with audit verdicts:
- the length table is now _utf8_length, read through the utf8_length pointer, which lbuf_search() swaps to stop its threads (threaded_search); both documented.
- uc_chr()/uc_sub() are now defined here (upstream moved them out of vi.h); their briefs move along.
- uc_dup() no longer exists; its comment is dropped.
Comments only; stripped binary identical.
---
 uc.c | 82 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 65 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

